{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13395","headline":"夕次鹿门山作 · 阎防","name":"夕次鹿门山作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庞公嘉遯所，浪迹难追攀。\n浮舟暝始至，抱杖聊自闲。\n双岩开鹿门，百谷集珠湾。\n喷薄湍上水，舂容漂里山。\n焦原不足险，梁壑未成艰。\n我行自春仲，夏鸟忽緜蛮。\n蕙草色已晚，客心殊倦还。\n远游非避地，访道爱童颜。\n安能徇机巧争夺锥刀间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}